WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You saw the first target. Now watch what comes next.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A second target arrives while the first is still being processed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In some experiments, people often fail to report it.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The effect depends on the spacing and the task—not a universal shutdown.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Training research is intriguing, but no retail audio was tested.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Find the paper. Test the claim. Keep the distinction.
